WEBVTT

00:04.540 --> 00:07.080
I have less presence than other people.

00:07.420 --> 00:13.210
That's why it's common for people not to do a double
take, but a quintiple take when they finally notice me.

00:14.630 --> 00:16.290
That being said...

00:19.750 --> 00:22.000
Kubo-san is the only one who can find me.

00:22.540 --> 00:24.670
Stare.

00:22.960 --> 00:26.420
<b>Stare</b>

00:24.670 --> 00:26.080
What's with this gap?

00:26.420 --> 00:28.830
Kubocchi! Have you seen Shiraishi?

00:29.540 --> 00:32.710
You said you're an ace at finding him, right?

00:32.710 --> 00:35.710
Right? I'm rolling gacha today.

00:36.540 --> 00:37.880
Hmm.

00:40.580 --> 00:42.330
I haven't seen him today.

00:42.330 --> 00:45.830
What? But I want to pray to Shiraishi for luck!

00:45.920 --> 00:48.170
Sorry that I couldn't help.

00:48.170 --> 00:49.750
I'm gonna look for him!

00:52.460 --> 00:56.420
Or at least I thought Kubo-san could always find me.

00:58.130 --> 00:58.920
Wait.

00:59.210 --> 01:02.170
Kubo-san definitely saw me.

00:59.380 --> 01:02.170
Stare.

01:02.380 --> 01:04.580
But why did she lie about it?

01:08.670 --> 01:09.540
Shiraishi-kun.

01:11.210 --> 01:12.750
You've got bed head.

01:14.170 --> 01:15.710
Your hair's sticking up all weird.

01:18.170 --> 01:18.750
Huh?

01:19.380 --> 01:21.830
I thought you'd be embarrassed if people saw.

01:21.830 --> 01:24.750
If I keep my lips zipped, probably no one else will notice.

01:26.170 --> 01:27.330
I'll fix it.

01:27.330 --> 01:29.330
M'kay! See you later.

01:34.920 --> 01:37.330
That's the first time I've seen him with bed head.

01:37.630 --> 01:40.040
Too cute!

01:41.920 --> 01:44.750
Jikan yo tomare

01:44.750 --> 01:48.790
Sukoshi dake

01:50.960 --> 01:54.380
Hajimari wa itsu datta?

01:54.380 --> 01:58.040
Mou oboetenai kedo

01:58.880 --> 02:02.630
Sore mo ii ka tte sa

02:02.630 --> 02:05.380
Taai mo nai koto

02:05.920 --> 02:08.960
Itsudatte ki ga tsukeba

02:08.960 --> 02:13.080
Waratte naitari shite

02:13.540 --> 02:19.040
Tamani iji hattari mo shitari ne

02:20.380 --> 02:30.330
Shingou ga kawareba seeno de susumu ikisaki (konomama)

02:30.330 --> 02:34.290
Iwanakutemo (dokomademo)

02:34.460 --> 02:37.420
Ikeru yo ne kitto

02:37.420 --> 02:41.080
Dramatic janakutemo

02:41.250 --> 02:44.920
Taikutsu da to nagetemo

02:45.210 --> 02:50.130
Itsuka futo omoidasu

02:50.580 --> 02:51.580
Kyou o

02:52.130 --> 02:55.830
Romantic na kotoba mo

02:56.000 --> 02:59.420
Nakute ii yo dakara

02:59.500 --> 03:02.170
Jikan yo tomare

03:02.170 --> 03:06.080
Sukoshi dake

03:06.580 --> 03:08.540
Tsubuyaita

03:16.670 --> 03:21.380
It's a little inconvenient when I drop or forget something.

03:16.880 --> 03:21.630
<b>Episode 6: Nurse's Office and Main Character</b>

03:21.630 --> 03:25.630
<b>Identification Card</b>

03:21.630 --> 03:25.630
<b>Junta Shiraishi</b>

03:22.380 --> 03:26.710
That's because when another person
notices something I dropped or forgot,

03:26.830 --> 03:27.540
Huh?

03:28.460 --> 03:32.460
it's common that they lose sight of me right after.

03:33.130 --> 03:36.210
That's why I normally take care
to prevent that from happening.

03:36.630 --> 03:42.040
But just like what happened with my student ID,
I accidently drop stuff occasionally.

03:47.330 --> 03:48.710
You dropped this.

03:48.710 --> 03:49.460
Huh?

03:51.290 --> 03:52.710
Th-thanks.

03:53.250 --> 03:59.250
But lately, it seems like I've been
getting spotted more often these days.

04:00.290 --> 04:02.210
What's with this weird feeling?

04:02.670 --> 04:05.290
Is it because she spoke to me first?

04:06.330 --> 04:07.170
That's not it.

04:07.790 --> 04:10.920
I feel like I've seen someone who looks like her before.

04:11.580 --> 04:13.580
Oh, what's going on here, Saki?

04:16.460 --> 04:18.170
Huh? Aren't you...

04:18.380 --> 04:19.670
Isn't she...

04:20.330 --> 04:21.420
The employee from the bookstore?

04:21.420 --> 04:24.380
Ah! You're the boy who was reading that porno mag!

04:25.880 --> 04:27.170
That's how she recognized me.

04:28.290 --> 04:29.580
But I wasn't reading it.

04:29.580 --> 04:34.250
There you go again! Did you get
your student ID back from Nagisa?

04:34.250 --> 04:36.630
Nagisa? My student ID?

04:36.960 --> 04:41.670
Um, Kubo-san said her sister was
the one who found my ID.

04:42.540 --> 04:44.920
<b>Kubo</b>

04:46.830 --> 04:49.920
Wait, don't tell me you're her sister?

04:50.290 --> 04:53.960
Yep, that's me! I'm Akina Kubo, Nagisa's big sister.

04:55.130 --> 04:57.630
And this is our cousin, Saki Kubo.

04:58.170 --> 05:00.920
Thanks for getting along with Nagisa.

05:01.210 --> 05:03.580
Ah. I'm Junta Shiraishi.

05:05.080 --> 05:09.130
I thought she looked familiar. She looks like Kubo-san.

05:10.630 --> 05:14.420
Saki looks exactly like Nagisa did in middle school.

05:14.420 --> 05:16.210
R-really?

05:16.580 --> 05:17.830
She read my mind!

05:19.170 --> 05:21.040
Saki's such a cutie.

05:21.630 --> 05:23.880
She's cute, right? Right?

05:24.750 --> 05:25.630
Yeah, she i-

05:25.630 --> 05:26.540
Just like Nagisa.

05:29.500 --> 05:30.380
Um...

05:31.420 --> 05:32.710
My, oh, my!

05:33.080 --> 05:35.170
They're sisters, no doubt about that.

05:36.830 --> 05:41.790
Saki loves and admires Nagisa,
so she's growing her hair out now.

05:42.630 --> 05:47.540
Whaddya think? Won't she look more
like Nagisa if she grows her hair out?

05:48.880 --> 05:50.580
Yeah, I think so.

05:51.500 --> 05:54.290
Speaking of which, this is Nagisa in middle school.

05:55.000 --> 05:56.420
They're the spitting image of each other!

05:57.080 --> 05:59.790
Nagi-chan's cute, so that makes me happy.

06:01.830 --> 06:06.630
Do you think I could become as cute as Nagi-chan?

06:07.000 --> 06:07.790
Er.

06:08.420 --> 06:09.380
Kiddo.

06:10.630 --> 06:12.000
Answer her.

06:16.380 --> 06:18.750
I bet you could.

06:19.170 --> 06:22.580
Wow, a younger girl got you on that one, kiddo.

06:23.380 --> 06:27.380
I'll reward you with this photo of Nagisa.

06:27.380 --> 06:29.290
By all means, use it as a family heirloom.

06:29.920 --> 06:31.580
Huh? Ah, um...

06:31.580 --> 06:33.580
Come on, let's exchange Pine contact info.

06:40.790 --> 06:45.000
Dang, the Kubo DNA is extraordinary.

06:47.960 --> 06:49.040
We're back!

06:49.790 --> 06:52.540
Akina, Saki, welcome back!

06:53.210 --> 06:54.040
Nagi-chan!

06:54.630 --> 06:58.920
We ran into that guy who dropped
his student ID today. Shiraishi-kun, right?

06:59.170 --> 06:59.830
What!

07:00.420 --> 07:02.710
Oh, did I pique your curiosity?

07:03.630 --> 07:05.250
Not really.

07:05.670 --> 07:07.790
Did Shiraishi-kun say anything?

07:08.670 --> 07:10.380
He sure did! Right, Saki?

07:15.000 --> 07:21.420
Shiraishi-san said I'll be able
to become cute just like you.

07:23.080 --> 07:25.330
Really? That's great!

07:25.330 --> 07:26.000
Yeah!

07:27.790 --> 07:29.830
It's great for Nagisa too.

07:31.580 --> 07:32.420
Shut it.

07:33.380 --> 07:36.210
And we ended up exchanging Pine contact info.

07:36.670 --> 07:38.750
Invite him over to our place again sometime.

07:39.000 --> 07:43.880
<b>Shake</b>

07:39.000 --> 07:43.880
<b>shake</b>

07:39.170 --> 07:41.420
Huh? Um, again?

07:41.670 --> 07:43.790
How did you know?

07:44.040 --> 07:47.210
What? You really had him over?

07:47.670 --> 07:48.830
Oh my gosh!

07:49.630 --> 07:51.630
Akina!

07:52.130 --> 07:55.080
You and Shiraishi-san must be good friends then.

07:55.630 --> 07:56.250
Huh?

07:56.580 --> 07:57.540
Oh, my!

07:59.750 --> 08:02.000
Why is Saki pouting?

08:05.380 --> 08:08.790
Come to think of it, Junta,
finals are coming up soon, right?

08:09.040 --> 08:09.580
Yep.

08:09.960 --> 08:11.580
Is your studying going well?

08:12.330 --> 08:14.380
Well, it's going all right.

08:15.670 --> 08:16.290
Ah.

08:16.920 --> 08:20.540
If your grades go down,
I'll ground you from video games.

08:21.420 --> 08:22.000
Huh?

08:24.130 --> 08:28.540
Everyone, final exams are next week, so study hard!

08:29.170 --> 08:30.540
Finals, huh?

08:32.000 --> 08:38.920
Speaking of tests, it's really difficult to get the teachers
attention if I drop my eraser since I'm invisible.

08:39.670 --> 08:42.920
They don't notice me even if I raise my hand, of course.

08:43.960 --> 08:47.880
So on test days, I bring ten erasers with me.

08:49.330 --> 08:52.580
If my grades take a hit, mom will confiscate my games.

08:53.040 --> 08:55.580
I have to prevent from happening at all costs.

08:56.130 --> 08:58.290
Hazuki, help me study!

08:58.290 --> 08:59.750
If I must.

09:01.210 --> 09:04.790
There are a lot of people studying
in the classroom today.

09:05.630 --> 09:07.460
Studying with friends...

09:07.790 --> 09:09.250
That's out of the question for me.

09:09.330 --> 09:11.830
<b>Library</b>

09:17.080 --> 09:20.960
Whoa, I don't even understand what
I don't understand on this question.

09:22.580 --> 09:24.460
What do I do? This will be on the-

09:25.040 --> 09:25.580
Final!

09:27.170 --> 09:27.750
Huh?

09:28.750 --> 09:30.960
Kubo-san! Why are you here?

09:31.130 --> 09:34.290
Shiraishi-kun, keep it down in the library.

09:35.670 --> 09:37.540
I came to return a book.

09:37.540 --> 09:39.040
O-oh, okay.

09:39.420 --> 09:40.790
Are you studying?

09:40.790 --> 09:42.830
Huh? Oh, yeah.

09:43.580 --> 09:45.540
I studied this yesterday.

09:45.880 --> 09:47.750
I can help you on the parts you don't get.

09:48.170 --> 09:48.710
Huh?

09:48.920 --> 09:50.830
I insist, I insist!

09:51.170 --> 09:51.750
Ah!

09:52.420 --> 09:53.790
Give me just a sec!

09:56.750 --> 09:59.830
I'm your teacher now.

10:00.080 --> 10:02.040
Where'd she get glasses?

10:02.790 --> 10:06.170
I'm friends with a student librarian,
so I borrowed these from her.

10:06.500 --> 10:08.460
She read my mind.

10:08.460 --> 10:09.380
I see.

10:10.210 --> 10:13.080
Come to think of it, Kubo-san is smart.

10:13.420 --> 10:17.460
So if I ask her about the parts
that are flying over my head...

10:18.380 --> 10:20.210
But it's Kubo-san we're talking about.

10:21.880 --> 10:25.580
Hmm, what shall I have you do if you get it wrong?

10:25.920 --> 10:26.710
Or maybe she'll say...

10:27.250 --> 10:30.830
You don't even understand that either?

10:31.380 --> 10:32.880
I can imagine her saying stuff like that.

10:33.130 --> 10:40.000
<b>Being made fun</b>

10:33.130 --> 10:40.000
<b>of by Kubo-san</b>

10:33.130 --> 10:40.000
<b>Games getting</b>

10:33.130 --> 10:40.000
<b>confiscated</b>

10:33.460 --> 10:38.000
But I really don't get this stuff, and if my grades drop,
I can kiss my games goodbye.

10:38.000 --> 10:39.630
No pain, no gain.

10:40.960 --> 10:43.000
I can't figure out question five.

10:43.330 --> 10:44.880
She'll tease me for sure.

10:46.290 --> 10:47.670
Question five, huh?

10:47.920 --> 10:49.580
Let me see the question.

10:50.290 --> 10:54.540
If you don't get this question,
then questions three and four...

10:54.960 --> 10:57.250
Ah, you got them wrong.

10:57.580 --> 11:00.460
Question five applies questions three and four.

11:00.460 --> 11:03.920
So you need to completely have a grasp on these
formulas to solve it.

11:04.420 --> 11:06.920
Let's give questions three and four a shot first.

11:07.630 --> 11:08.630
Huh?

11:10.130 --> 11:12.500
Did I say something weird?

11:12.750 --> 11:15.380
Er... Um, it's just...

11:16.040 --> 11:21.960
Did you think I'd make fun of you and say things like,
"How come you can't even figure out this question?"

11:22.500 --> 11:23.040
No.

11:23.250 --> 11:25.040
Your face says otherwise.

11:26.750 --> 11:29.500
Well, this goes for other things besides studying,

11:29.960 --> 11:35.330
but I'd never laugh at someone trying
their best to learn how to do something.

11:39.210 --> 11:42.210
<b>Today's</b>

11:39.210 --> 11:42.210
<b>recommended books</b>

11:39.540 --> 11:41.330
All right, shall we tackle these questions?

11:46.130 --> 11:48.420
I realized something from this tutoring session.

11:49.170 --> 11:50.380
Yes, that's correct!

11:50.380 --> 11:52.710
Kubo-san is awesome at teaching.

11:53.080 --> 11:55.080
She's almost like a real teacher.

11:55.460 --> 11:56.380
Shiraishi-kun.

11:56.790 --> 11:58.080
Good job.

12:01.210 --> 12:02.750
You're making a funny face.

12:03.000 --> 12:05.790
Are you studying in the library again tomorrow?

12:06.540 --> 12:08.420
Er... Uh, probably.

12:09.670 --> 12:13.040
Gotcha. Then let's study together again tomorrow.

12:13.380 --> 12:14.630
Bye-bye, Shiraishi-kun!

12:15.210 --> 12:16.540
Thanks for the glasses!

12:16.880 --> 12:18.830
No problem. They're fake anyway.

12:19.750 --> 12:21.040
See you tomorrow!

12:21.420 --> 12:22.710
See you tomorrow.

12:25.290 --> 12:27.380
I guess I should go home now too.

12:28.500 --> 12:33.460
I studied with someone else.
I thought that was something I'd never experience.

12:36.000 --> 12:38.380
We're meeting up again tomorrow, huh?

12:39.920 --> 12:43.710
I'm looking forward to tomorrow a little bit.

12:45.580 --> 12:47.630
But the next day,

12:48.130 --> 12:51.000
I came down with a fever and had to stay home.

12:56.920 --> 12:59.000
This is the first time I've ever missed school.

12:59.670 --> 13:04.290
I'm not trying to brag, but I've gotten awards
for perfect attendance since elementary school.

13:05.000 --> 13:06.080
Right, well...

13:06.080 --> 13:10.130
Well, since I'm invisible, it won't matter much anyway.

13:10.880 --> 13:14.670
My classmates probably won't even notice
until the teacher says something.

13:16.290 --> 13:17.670
If someone did notice...

13:19.790 --> 13:21.080
My head hurts.

13:25.040 --> 13:28.040
<b>Oranges</b>

13:25.580 --> 13:27.920
Well, homeroom's over.

13:28.380 --> 13:32.540
Oh, that's right. Shiraishi got sick and is absent today.

13:32.540 --> 13:35.790
There's a bug going around, so everyone be careful!

13:36.420 --> 13:38.580
Hey, Shiraishi is absent.

13:39.040 --> 13:40.500
He sure is.

13:40.500 --> 13:42.210
I didn't even notice.

13:42.210 --> 13:44.790
Well, he always goes unnoticed.

13:45.580 --> 13:47.330
Did you notice, Kubocchi?

13:47.330 --> 13:47.830
Huh?

13:50.880 --> 13:54.000
I also didn't notice until the teacher brought it up.

13:54.420 --> 13:55.670
Same!

13:56.540 --> 13:58.330
She totally noticed.

14:04.790 --> 14:07.290
<b>Shiraishi-kun</b>

14:04.790 --> 14:07.290
<b>How are you holding up?</b>

14:10.290 --> 14:12.790
<b>Shiraishi-kun</b>

14:10.290 --> 14:12.790
<b>Can I come visit you?</b>

14:27.420 --> 14:29.000
What's wrong, Nagisa?

14:29.000 --> 14:29.540
Huh?

14:29.830 --> 14:31.420
Class is over.

14:32.170 --> 14:32.880
Oh!

14:35.040 --> 14:38.670
Hey, Kubocchi. Visit me if I get sick, okay?

14:38.670 --> 14:40.250
Where'd that come from?

14:40.880 --> 14:47.630
If I got sick and a girl like you worried about me
and visited me, I bet that'd cure me of my cold!

14:48.460 --> 14:49.830
You think so?

14:51.080 --> 14:55.170
What are you talking about? It's usually a pain
in the butt if someone pops by when you're sick.

14:55.170 --> 14:56.710
Ah, that's true.

14:59.460 --> 15:02.500
So? Are you sticking around?

15:02.630 --> 15:05.540
Yeah. You two can go on ahead without me.

15:05.920 --> 15:08.080
Okey dokey! See you tomorrow!

15:08.500 --> 15:09.750
See you tomorrow!

15:11.380 --> 15:13.330
Seems like you're coming down with a cold.

15:13.330 --> 15:15.460
What, that's not true!

15:21.130 --> 15:24.000
What can I send him that won't be annoying?

15:26.080 --> 15:29.420
"Are you okay?" But he's not okay.

15:30.080 --> 15:33.290
Maybe the safest bet is, "Get well soon."

15:34.670 --> 15:36.290
And as for a home visit...

15:38.540 --> 15:41.040
<b> But we were supposed to study together!</b>

15:41.290 --> 15:42.830
That's no good.

15:54.040 --> 15:55.790
<b>Are you going to school tomorrow?</b>

15:56.330 --> 15:57.000
There.

16:09.290 --> 16:11.790
<b>Kubo-san</b>

16:09.290 --> 16:11.790
<b>Are you going to school tomorrow?</b>

16:10.130 --> 16:11.630
Oh, it's from Kubo-san.

16:15.790 --> 16:18.040
<b>Today</b>

16:15.790 --> 16:18.040
<b>Kubo-san</b>

16:15.790 --> 16:18.040
<b>Are you going to school tomorrow?</b>

16:15.790 --> 16:16.960
<b>I think I'll be able to</b>

16:16.960 --> 16:18.040
<b>I think I'll be able to</b>

16:18.170 --> 16:19.790
Big bwutha, let's pway!

16:19.790 --> 16:20.960
Whoa, Seita!

16:20.960 --> 16:22.290
Pway!

16:21.130 --> 16:23.710
Hey! I'm still sick!

16:23.710 --> 16:26.170
Ah, don't touch my phone!

16:23.880 --> 16:26.170
Touch, touch, touch!

16:26.170 --> 16:27.580
Mom! Mom!

16:27.580 --> 16:28.330
Touch!

16:30.630 --> 16:32.290
Cr-crap!

16:32.500 --> 16:35.330
What've you done, Seita?

16:32.500 --> 16:33.750
<b>I think I'll be able to</b>

16:32.500 --> 16:33.750
<b>Read</b>

16:32.500 --> 16:35.670
<b>I miss you</b>

16:32.500 --> 16:35.670
<b>I miss you</b>

16:32.500 --> 16:35.670
<b>Read</b>

16:48.500 --> 16:51.250
<b>Sorry! That was Seita!!!</b>

16:48.500 --> 16:51.250
<b>He tapped on that stamp!</b>

16:53.880 --> 16:56.080
Oh, okay. It was Seita-kun...

16:57.830 --> 16:59.380
In that case, I'll return the favor.

16:59.960 --> 17:02.210
Big bwutha! Big bwutha!

17:02.210 --> 17:07.460
Hey now, your brother's still resting.
Let's leave him be, Seita.

17:09.880 --> 17:10.630
Huh?

17:10.790 --> 17:13.790
<b>Lonely</b>

17:10.790 --> 17:13.790
<b>without</b>

17:10.790 --> 17:13.790
<b>you...</b>

17:10.790 --> 17:13.790
<b>Squeeze</b>

17:11.710 --> 17:12.670
What...

17:18.040 --> 17:22.540
<b>My sister sent that stamp!</b>

17:19.080 --> 17:21.920
So it was her sister. That freaked me out.

17:25.080 --> 17:28.330
I feel like my temperature just went up again.

17:36.880 --> 17:37.750
I'll head home.

17:44.580 --> 17:47.580
<b>Now</b>

17:44.580 --> 17:47.580
<b>Akina</b>

17:44.590 --> 17:47.580
<b>Text Message</b>

17:45.420 --> 17:47.130
What do you want, Akina?

17:55.710 --> 17:56.790
That was cold.

17:57.920 --> 18:01.920
<b>Achoo!</b>

18:07.040 --> 18:08.460
<b>Ding</b>

18:07.710 --> 18:09.000
I'm late.

18:10.380 --> 18:12.000
But odds are I'll get away with it.

18:12.000 --> 18:14.460
They shouldn't even realize I'm not there.

18:15.540 --> 18:17.830
I could just nonchalantly slip into the classroom.

18:18.080 --> 18:19.670
You're late, you're late!

18:21.250 --> 18:24.830
I might as well wait until second period
if no one's noticed anyway.

18:27.250 --> 18:27.960
Oh?

18:28.420 --> 18:29.710
Oh, Kubo-san.

18:30.040 --> 18:32.000
Ah, Shiraishi-kun!

18:33.710 --> 18:36.460
Kubo-san seems sorta out of it.

18:37.540 --> 18:38.000
Oh!

18:40.500 --> 18:44.830
Ah, sorry. I feeling a little dizzy.

18:45.250 --> 18:45.830
Um.

18:45.830 --> 18:50.170
You weren't actually absent today. I'm glad.

18:50.500 --> 18:51.290
Er.

18:51.290 --> 18:55.250
But since you're here, does that mean
you were late? That's a no-no.

18:55.960 --> 18:57.460
Ow!

18:57.460 --> 18:58.380
Are you all right?

18:58.710 --> 19:02.130
I'm a bit feverish, so I'm on my way to the nurse's office.

19:02.250 --> 19:03.880
Oh, okay.

19:04.420 --> 19:06.750
Mm-hmm. Sorry for holding you up.

19:06.960 --> 19:09.500
Have someone go with you to the nurse's office.

19:09.710 --> 19:11.500
It's not safe when you're that dizzy.

19:11.880 --> 19:15.380
Everyone's taking a quiz right now,
so it's a bad time to ask.

19:15.580 --> 19:19.290
Hey Shiraishi-kun, you'd better hurry to class.

19:21.580 --> 19:22.290
Yeah.

19:23.420 --> 19:26.130
Kubo-san's definitely not okay.

19:27.210 --> 19:31.250
They're in the middle of a quiz,
so no one can go with her to the nurse's office.

19:31.790 --> 19:35.080
But I'm worried she'll fall on the stairs.

19:35.330 --> 19:38.670
I was planning on skipping first period from the outset.

19:39.540 --> 19:42.330
And maybe she got infected because of me.

19:44.380 --> 19:45.210
Kubo-san.

19:47.460 --> 19:49.630
Want me to go to the nurse's office with you?

19:52.630 --> 19:55.210
If you're struggling to walk, you can lean...

19:58.830 --> 20:01.000
Er. Um, never mind.

20:05.710 --> 20:08.080
You'll go with me to the nurse's office?

20:09.630 --> 20:11.380
It's no trouble at all.

20:15.920 --> 20:19.130
Thank you. I think I'll take you up on that offer.

20:28.670 --> 20:29.380
Okay.

20:32.630 --> 20:35.130
<b>School Infirmary</b>

20:33.920 --> 20:34.920
Excuse us.

20:35.500 --> 20:37.750
Huh? The nurse isn't here.

20:39.000 --> 20:39.500
Oh!

20:39.880 --> 20:41.580
First things first, I gotta take care of Kubo-san.

20:51.040 --> 20:53.460
What do I do? Should I look for the nurse?

20:54.380 --> 20:56.580
Maybe I should take her temperature.

20:58.670 --> 21:01.080
Shiraishi-kun, thank you.

21:02.000 --> 21:03.500
You're welcome.

21:07.670 --> 21:12.000
Your hand is cold. It feels nice.

21:18.540 --> 21:21.330
You're warm.

21:23.170 --> 21:24.630
Wait, she's asleep?

21:27.130 --> 21:28.630
For crying out loud!

21:29.170 --> 21:31.210
Huh? Is there someone in here?

21:31.380 --> 21:33.710
Yes! We let ourselves in, sorry!

21:33.710 --> 21:34.920
That's perfectly fine.

21:35.170 --> 21:38.670
She seems to have a slight fever, so I put her in bed.

21:38.670 --> 21:41.420
Ah, thank you. I've got the rest under control.

21:44.250 --> 21:45.880
Thank you.

21:46.250 --> 21:47.500
<b>School Infirmary</b>

21:55.750 --> 21:58.670
How should I put this? Today, I feel...

21:59.170 --> 22:00.750
Like a completely different person today.

22:02.460 --> 22:04.290
I know it's not like me,

22:06.750 --> 22:09.250
but I kinda feel like a main character.

22:11.040 --> 22:14.420
Akanesasu kousha no kage

22:14.420 --> 22:20.710
Mitsukaranai hazu no seishun no hashikko ni

22:20.960 --> 22:26.130
Sukoshi suwareta kamo, kedo sugu kiechau kamo

22:26.130 --> 22:30.380
Kimi ga waraikakete kureru koto mo

22:30.380 --> 22:32.290
Kirei da ne

22:32.290 --> 22:35.130
Kiseki tte yonde ii kana

22:35.380 --> 22:41.040
Konna hibi ga suki da yo, suki da yo, sukida yo

22:41.040 --> 22:47.500
Datte zutto tsuzuku wake janai kara, dakishimeru no

22:47.500 --> 22:51.630
Kodomo kara chotto fumidashita haru no hi ni

22:51.630 --> 22:55.000
Susume, susume, susume, ippo zutsu

22:55.000 --> 22:58.330
Ima kasuka de tashikana kaze ga fuku

22:58.330 --> 23:06.000
Semete boku to kimi no aida wa sekai ga sukoshi irozukimasu youni

23:06.000 --> 23:10.630
Donna canvas o egaku kana, donna mirai ni naru kana

23:10.630 --> 23:14.420
Wakaranai kedo shinjite mitaina

23:13.710 --> 23:18.000
Egao de te o futtara kitto

23:14.790 --> 23:17.830
Jaa mata ne to ie tara

23:17.830 --> 23:21.540
Ashita ga sukoshi tanoshimi ni naru ne

23:21.630 --> 23:28.500
Kisetsu no hayasa ni sotte, kotoba kasaneru bokura

23:28.500 --> 23:34.920
Douka douka shiawase de arimasu youni da ne
